  "statuteText": "263:36 Reciprocal Driving of Pleasure Vehicles. –\n\nNo owner of a pleasure vehicle, and no nonresident or driver thereof, holding a license to drive in the state, district, or country in which he resides shall be required to obtain a license to drive such vehicle within this state."
